    <main class="about-page">
        <div class="about-header">
            <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT SEVAPOINT</p>
            <h1>Public services, made easier.</h1>
            <p>SevaPoint helps people find, understand, and safely access public services from one trusted guide.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-layout">
            <section class="about-info">
                <div class="about-icon">S</div>
                <h2>Find. Verify. Access.</h2>
                <p>Government services can be difficult to find and confusing to navigate. SevaPoint brings useful service information together and guides visitors toward genuine official websites.</p>
                <p>SevaPoint is an independent public-service guide. It is not a government website and does not replace official government portals.</p>
            </section>

        </div>

        <section class="team-section">
            <div class="team-heading">
                <p class="eyebrow">MEET THE TEAM</p>
