                </article>
                <article class="team-card">
                    <div class="team-initial">KG</div>
                    <h3>Kamlesh Gurjar</h3>
                    <p class="founder-role">Co-founder &amp; Developer</p>
                    <p>Helps build and improve the platform’s features.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="team-card">
                    <div class="team-initial">LV</div>
                    <h3>Lakshay Verma</h3>
