                </article>
                <article class="team-card">
                    <div class="team-initial">VR</div>
                    <h3>Vijay Pratap Singh Rathore</h3>
                    <p class="founder-role">Co-founder &amp; Website Management</p>
                    <p>Manages the website and keeps it running smoothly.</p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>
